  <h2>Information we handle</h2>
  <p><strong>Files you upload.</strong> File tools process your files in memory to create the result and delete them straight after. We do not keep or look at your files.</p>
  <p><strong>Calculator inputs.</strong> Tools such as the time, grade and dice tools run in your browser. What you type is not sent to our servers.</p>
  <p><strong>Technical data.</strong> Like most websites, our servers may record your IP address, browser type, pages visited and the time of the request in standard logs. We use this to keep the site secure, prevent abuse and apply daily usage limits.</p>
  <p><strong>Cookies.</strong> We set a small cookie called "vid" to apply the free daily usage limit. It contains a random identifier, not your name or email.</p>

  <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
  <p>We may show ads served by Google AdSense and other third-party vendors. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and other sites on the internet.</p>
  <p>You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, or by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="nofollow noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>. You can also control cookies in your browser settings.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>If we use an analytics service (for example Google Analytics or Search Console), it collects aggregated usage information such as pages viewed and approximate location. Update this section to match the services you really use.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Our site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live (for example California or the European Economic Area) you may have rights to access, correct or delete personal data we hold about you. Email us and we will respond as required by law.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>
